{
  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量营销-人群定向、DMP 与 RTA\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量营销\"],\"capability_summary\":\"查询客户下存在的人群包列表和信息，包括人群包的id，可用状态，来源，覆盖人群等，可查到客户id下所有人群包，无论是API创建的还是平台创建的。配合接口有【获取Access-Token】、【附录-返回码】、【附录-DMP相关-人群包来源】、【附录-DMP相关-人群包状态】。\",\"id\":\"ad.dmp_custom_audience.select\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/dmp/custom_audience/select/\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1696710570721295\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"get_access_token\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"请求此接口需要授权access-token，获取方法见该文档\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access-Token\"},{\"id\":\"appendix_return_code\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710760866831\",\"reason\":\"接口返回码和返回信息的详细说明参考该文档\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"附录-返回码\"},{\"id\":\"appendix_dmp_custom_audience_source\",\"path\":\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710761459712#custom-anchor-人群包来源\",\"reason\":\"接口应答中人群包来源的详细说明参考该文档\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"附录-DMP相关-人群包来源\"},{\"id\":\"appendix_dmp_custom_audience_status\",\"path\":\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710761459712#custom-anchor-人群包状态\",\"reason\":\"接口应答中人群包状态的详细说明参考该文档\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"附录-DMP相关-人群包状态\"}],\"risk_level\":\"low\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1696710570721295\",\"title\":\"人群包列表\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-JUueojyB\">通过此接口你可以查询客户下存在的人群包列表和信息。</p><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-8pn9scrr\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-frteTwux\">信息包括人群包的id，可用状态，来源，覆盖人群等； 该接口可以查到客户id下所有人群包，无论是API创建的还是平台创建的。</p></blockquote>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201761036913921102%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201743864733602830%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-DuuHbw4j\" id=\"h6f20189-DuuHbw4j\">请求地址</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-DItzhzln\"><a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/dmp/custom_audience/select/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">https://ad.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/dmp/custom_audience/select/</span></a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1696710570721295\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847394521222599\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-KybKGcX3\" id=\"h6f20189-KybKGcX3\">请求方法</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-LrAhU1Oy\">GET</p><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-OVubng7d\" id=\"h6f20189-OVubng7d\">请求Header</h3><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t615773a-A8dONSTl\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-Ta064bAR\"><col data-id=\"cea4ea70-AAg95NXK\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.48519362186788%\"/><col data-id=\"c7cea535-G1maaAeZ\" span=\"1\" width=\"21.64009111617312%\"/><col data-id=\"c82ac99f-ekIQb3NT\" span=\"1\" width=\"44.874715261959%\"/></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-hRd5Kfgh\"><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-uHXhz3Vh\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-9ae8hnKA\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-pX7oIlaB\">字段</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-0qsC6TX8\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-qZsQNAJW\">类型</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-BKYJPna1\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-XXNdnrDE\">描述</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-WNR7RnZH\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-e7r0TWhM\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Yq99ax2x\">Access-Token<span style=\"color: #338aff;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ebf3ff;\">必填</span></span></p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-fVJXZUFj\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-TqVySr2c\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row table-last-column\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t78358bf-8Scfdkbn\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-zanO3SCc\">授权access-token，获取方法见接口文档<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\">【获取Access-Token】</a></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-BB5iqzmq\" id=\"h6f20189-BB5iqzmq\">请求参数</h3><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t615773a-l04FBUD1\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-kYbp7fKe\"><col data-id=\"c91dc429-d9N0ko1e\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.44709897610921%\"/><col data-id=\"c9554d0f-Ni1enFPd\" span=\"1\" width=\"21.61547212741752%\"/><col data-id=\"cb89b439-d5I6d4Zg\" span=\"1\" width=\"44.937428896473264%\"/></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-USl1b103\"><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-10M1zDP3\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-1ef38apg\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-y3E95UUN\">字段</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-qCdvZgSb\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-H3gUrJRz\">类型</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-deoTJE7d\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-5WlcLNlL\">描述</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-9aPYPb8J\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-KNhP2GpI\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-kZbdEwjj\">advertiser_id <span class=\"qz-tag-view qz-tag-type-must\" data-type=\"tag\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22tagType%22%3A%22must%22%2C%22tagValue%22%3A%22%E5%BF%85%E5%A1%AB%22%2C%22isCustom%22%3Afalse%2C%22id%22%3A%226qIkW%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\" style=\"color:#338aff;background:#ebf3ff;\">必填</span></p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-RHtY8zm2\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-lYViLAnZ\">number</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-13njrHf7\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-8tXiKuyN\">客户ID</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-wqMdNNj1\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-uN0sM02o\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-OOtkZBlN\">select_type <span class=\"qz-tag-view qz-tag-type-must\" data-type=\"tag\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22tagType%22%3A%22must%22%2C%22tagValue%22%3A%22%E5%BF%85%E5%A1%AB%22%2C%22isCustom%22%3Afalse%2C%22id%22%3A%22nyUcK%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\" style=\"color:#338aff;background:#ebf3ff;\">必填</span></p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-vHDMBbmc\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-jeqPfrw4\">number</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-guDUGc8j\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-EtbweRZx\">查询类型,枚举值：<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">\"0\"</code>：该客户创建的人群包和被推送给该客户的人群包，<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">\"1\"</code>：状态为可投放的人群包</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-fDb2lAY6\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-m1odxx4T\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ZEzkAFGf\">offset</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-X6UauhPd\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-UhqAVz24\">number</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-an5Mpro5\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-5N8WsanO\">偏移,类似于SQL中offset(起始为0,翻页时new_offset=old_offset+limit），默认值：<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">0</code>，取值范围:<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">≥ 0</code></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-E8VxbLrM\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-eGR6U3Qe\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-J45Bpv12\">limit</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-75L6eaP4\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-vOVyFV6l\">number</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tb7d4c2b-bkjl6Djh\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-CDCIJug4\">返回数据量，默认值：<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">100</code>，取值范围：<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">1-100</code></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-otwUO2l7\" id=\"h6f20189-otwUO2l7\">请求示例</h3><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-mulit-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"multicodeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22langs%22%3A%5B%7B%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22def%20select_ta()%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20import%20requests%5Cn%20%20%