ertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-m4GL2Wp5\"><span class=\"qz-table-level qz-table-level-2\" data-level=\"2\" data-type=\"level\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22level%22%3A2%2C%22id%22%3A%225yHvo%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\"> </span>name</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-LztkQLnw\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-uPmUeMAp\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-RjMlZ3DB\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-zsHfArkc\">人群包名称</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-3kbYVWMp\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-HGfPeu5a\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-j0Bhayc9\"><span class=\"qz-table-level qz-table-level-2\" data-level=\"2\" data-type=\"level\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22level%22%3A2%2C%22id%22%3A%22cd3lr%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\"> </span>source</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-72q6prf0\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ExHlnYHo\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-2BT15YWu\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-DvmGKXtM\">人群包来源，详见<a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710761459712#custom-anchor-人群包来源\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\">【附录-DMP相关-人群包来源】</a></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-Y1R7i0Y1\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-dw7w7Lqp\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-n6ANLrYc\"><span class=\"qz-table-level qz-table-level-2\" data-level=\"2\" data-type=\"level\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22level%22%3A2%2C%22id%22%3A%22ggByZ%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\"> </span>status</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-4hKDyBiC\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-qgGUB15y\">number</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-dFwM6Q9u\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-yR0bGczU\">人群包状态，详见<a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710761459712#custom-anchor-人群包状态\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\">【附录-DMP相关-人群包状态】</a></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-EJIhGsfY\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-xbE18UrU\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-RA8XdmiX\"><span class=\"qz-table-level qz-table-level-2\" data-level=\"2\" data-type=\"level\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22level%22%3A2%2C%22id%22%3A%22LK1zT%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\"> </span>delivery_status</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-KdABtYPP\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Srr2YrZR\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-4AoEePqa\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-wqomdoxA\">人群包可投放状态，只有当状态为<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">CUSTOM_AUDIENCE_DELIVERY_STATUS_AVAILABLE</code>时才可进行投放使用<br/><strong>可选值：</strong><br/><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">CUSTOM_AUDIENCE_DELIVERY_STATUS_AVAILABLE</code>：可投放，人群包发布完成且推送完成<br/><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">CUSTOM_AUDIENCE_DELIVERY_STATUS_NEED_PUSH</code>：不可投放，人群包发布完成，但未推送，需要进行推送后再使用<br/><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">CUSTOM_AUDIENCE_DELIVERY_STATUS_NEED_PUBLISH</code>：不可投放，群包未发布但已推送，需要进行发布后再使用<br/><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">CUSTOM_AUDIENCE_DELIVERY_STATUS_UNAVAILABLE</code>：不可投放，未发布完成且未推送</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-HFrFp72U\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-rf5Oi5wa\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-1X3kDgh9\"><span class=\"qz-table-level qz-table-level-2\" data-level=\"2\" data-type=\"level\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22level%22%3A2%2C%22id%22%3A%22cBl6L%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\"> </span>cover_num</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-1mbMHfBg\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-QdWZVwGP\">number</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-Kv65CYOb\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ltCqpsjF\">人群包覆盖人群数目，基于<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">\"upload_num\"</code>：上传数据源包含的人群数目与uid对应后，再与头条系产品MAU交集后的数量（存在一个设备号/手机号对应多个uid的情况）<br/>实际数量可能多于/少于<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">\"upload_num\"</code>：上传数据源包含的人群数目</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-y668cVfe\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-fKFveVfU\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-WXZBJdkY\"><span class=\"qz-table-level qz-table-level-2\" data-level=\"2\" data-type=\"level\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22level%22%3A2%2C%22id%22%3A%22YQRVh%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\"> </span>upload_num</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-fbFljS2z\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-vsBvWXIh\">number</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-upmlp93t\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-yZzYMafE\">上传数据源包含的人群数目</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-a1Vzs2Yz\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-DRO3fdaW\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-qwoJeWP9\"><span class=\"qz-table-level qz-table-level-2\" data-level=\"2\" data-type=\"level\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22level%22%3A2%2C%22id%22%3A%22rNuZ9%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\"> </span>tag</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-awhkWUC1\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-9gS1QFv0\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-ng4PnXE5\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-nQEoBIv7\">人群包标签，通过数据源创建的人群包，标签会默认为\"API文件数据源\"</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-2f2ZTZC3\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-yNBNcuTu\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-HAanjy8O\"><span class=\"qz-table-level qz-table-level-1\" data-level=\"1\" data-type=\"level